# Prettier checks with endOfLine "lf". The repo's core.autocrlf=true would hand a
# fresh checkout CRLF files, and `npm run lint` would then fail on every file
# without a single source change. Pin the web tree to LF, the same way
# server/.gitattributes pins the Go tree for gofmt.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Screenshots and the lockfile are not line-ending material.
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
